---
description: Push finished work to GitHub
alwaysApply: true
---

When a requested change is finished, commit it and push to origin without waiting for a separate push request.

- Set GIT_AUTHOR_NAME, GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL, GIT_COMMITTER_NAME, and GIT_COMMITTER_EMAIL to eloyprqq and eloyprqq@gmail.com for the commit. Do not change git config.
- On PowerShell, pass the commit message with a here-string.
- Do not commit secrets. If there is nothing to commit, do not create an empty commit.
